{"segs": ["ZH_X24_0463_001:0602a19", "ZH_X24_0463_001:0602a20"], "en": "II. Displaying the Path to Enlightenment and Establishing the Three Great Beneficial Dharmas (2). A.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T20:25:16Z"},
{"segs": ["ZH_X24_0463_001:0602a21"], "en": "First, Comparing the Merit of the Dharma (2).", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T20:25:16Z"},
{"segs": ["ZH_X24_0463_001:0602a22"], "en": "1. First, raising the topic of the merit of giving;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T20:25:16Z"},
{"segs": ["ZH_X24_0463_001:0602a23"], "en": "2. Manifesting the benefit of the Dharma;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T20:25:16Z"},
{"segs": ["ZH_X24_0463_001:0602a24"], "en": "3. The true mark that eliminates emotional attachments (4).", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T20:25:16Z"},
{"segs": ["ZH_X24_0463_001:0602a25"], "en": "First, the dharma-realm is undefiled;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T20:25:16Z"},
{"segs": ["ZH_X24_0463_001:0602a26"], "en": "second, the establishment of the teaching through conditions;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T20:25:16Z"},
{"segs": ["ZH_X24_0463_001:0602a27"], "en": "third, according with sentient beings' inclinations and designating them as \"self.\"", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T20:25:16Z"},
{"segs": ["ZH_X24_0463_001:0602a28"], "en": "The four [aspects] that accord with wisdom are real,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T20:25:16Z"},
{"segs": ["ZH_X24_0463_001:0602a29"], "en": "and these four serve to encompass the Dharma-body (2).", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T20:25:16Z"},
{"segs": ["ZH_X24_0463_001:0602a30"], "en": "First, the manifestation of the Dharma-body (2).", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T20:25:16Z"},
{"segs": ["ZH_X24_0463_001:0602a31"], "en": "The first admonition and inquiry to Subhūti (4):", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T20:25:16Z"},
{"segs": ["ZH_X24_0463_001:0602a32"], "en": "first, an inquiry by way of corresponding characteristics;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T20:25:16Z"},
{"segs": ["ZH_X24_0463_001:0602a33"], "en": "second, a response by way of the reality of those characteristics.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T20:25:16Z"},
{"segs": ["ZH_X24_0463_001:0602a34"], "en": "Third, [the objection] that it consists solely of substance;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T20:25:16Z"},
{"segs": ["ZH_X24_0463_001:0602a35"], "en": "fourth, the resolution that it consists solely of substance.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T20:25:16Z"},
{"segs": ["ZH_X24_0463_001:0602a36"], "en": "Second, the formal demonstration of the Dharmakāya.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T20:25:16Z"},
{"segs": ["ZH_X24_0463_001:0602a37", "ZH_X24_0463_001:0602a38"], "en": "Second, preventing the one-sided grasping of the five [aggregates] as being neither saṃsāra nor nirvāṇa;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T20:25:16Z"},
{"segs": ["ZH_X24_0463_001:0602a39"], "en": "(2) first, not abiding in nirvāṇa; (2).", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T20:25:16Z"},
{"segs": ["ZH_X24_0463_001:0602a40"], "en": "First, guarding against what is non-virtuous;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T20:25:16Z"},
{"segs": ["ZH_X24_0463_001:0602a41", "ZH_X24_0463_001:0602a42"], "en": "second, manifesting the correct [path]. Second, for not abiding in saṃsāra. (2)", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T20:25:16Z"},
{"segs": ["ZH_X24_0463_001:0602a43"], "en": "First, the comparison and attainment of patience;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T20:25:16Z"},
{"segs": ["ZH_X24_0463_001:0602a44"], "en": "second, the demonstration of non-abiding.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T20:25:16Z"},
{"segs": ["ZH_X24_0463_001:0602a45"], "en": "(2) First, the indication.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T20:25:16Z"},
{"segs": ["ZH_X24_0463_001:0602a46", "ZH_X24_0463_001:0602a47"], "en": "2. A second detailed examination of the six as the purity of conduct and abiding (2).", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T20:25:16Z"},
{"segs": ["ZH_X24_0463_001:0602a48"], "en": "Part 1: Refuting Attachments (2).", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T20:25:16Z"},
{"segs": ["ZH_X24_0463_001:0602a49"], "en": "First, the conduct of the four postures (walking, standing, sitting, and lying down).", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T20:25:16Z"},
{"segs": ["ZH_X24_0463_001:0602a50"], "en": "Part One: Preventing what is improper;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T20:25:16Z"},
{"segs": ["ZH_X24_0463_001:0602a51"], "en": "Part Two: Manifesting what is correct.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T20:25:16Z"},
{"segs": ["ZH_X24_0463_001:0602a52"], "en": "2. Abiding in the Contemplative Practice of Name-and-Form (iii).", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T20:25:16Z"},
{"segs": ["ZH_X24_0463_001:0602a53"], "en": "Part One: Contemplating the Destruction of the Physical Body (i).", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T20:25:16Z"},
{"segs": ["ZH_X24_0463_001:0602a54"], "en": "Part One: The Skillful Means of Subtle Fragmentation.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T20:25:16Z"},
{"segs": ["ZH_X24_0463_001:0602a55"], "en": "Second, the skillful means of non-perception;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T20:25:16Z"},
{"segs": ["ZH_X24_0463_001:0602a56"], "en": "second, the contemplation that destroys the \"name-body\";", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T20:25:16Z"},
{"segs": ["ZH_X24_0463_001:0602a57"], "en": "third, the simultaneous explanation of the \"lump-grasping\" (piṇḍa-grāha).", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T20:25:16Z"},
{"segs": ["ZH_X24_0463_001:0602a58"], "en": "2. Refuting Views (2):", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T20:25:16Z"},
